<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- S1/VL1/B1: A2 composing F1 (in B1) and F4 (in B3); A3 composing F1 and F1b (named F1, in B3); A4 composing F1 and H2
     (under VL1 itself); A5 composing F1, F4 and F5 (in S1/VL3/B5); F1. S1/VL1/B3: V4 applying to F4; F4; F1b. S1/VL1: H2.
     S1/VL2: B1 holding a Function F1; B9 holding one LNode; a Function named B3 (same name as the bay, another tag).
     S1/VL3/B5 holds F5. -->
